docs {
  # Batch Get Access URLs

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/batch/urls`
  **Auth:** None (Public)

  ## Description

  Fetches active access URLs for a list of attachment IDs concurrently. For private files, generates freshly signed presigned GET URLs with the specified expiration. For public files, returns direct public URLs.

  ## Request

  ### Query Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `expiry` | `string` | No | Expiry duration for private URLs (e.g. `30m`, `1h`) |

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `ids` | `int64[]` | Yes | List of attachment IDs |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "access_url": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/doratou-storage/attachments/profile_image/2026/11/avatar.png"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "access_url": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/doratou-storage/attachments/expense_receipt/2026/11/receipt.jpg?..."
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```
}
